47,"tt":1854,"src":[5]},"florence":{"zh":"佛羅倫斯","en":"Florence","label":{"zh":"佛羅倫斯","en":"Florence"},"lat":43.7696,"lon":11.2558,"h":0,"side":"L","t":179.37,"dist":15558,"tt":2691,"src":[6]},"siena":{"zh":"西恩納","en":"Siena","label":{"zh":"西恩納","en":"Siena"},"lat":43.3186,"lon":11.3306,"h":0,"side":"B","t":201.41,"dist":510,"tt":2949,"src":[6,7]},"bolsena":{"zh":"博爾塞納湖","en":"Lake Bolsena","label":{"zh":"博爾塞納湖","en":"Lake Bolsena"},"lat":42.6,"lon":11.93333,"h":0,"side":"L","t":238.92,"dist":12888,"tt":3563,"src":[8]}},"shots":[{"t0":0.0,"dur":4.0,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":4.0,"dur":13.0,"zh":["蘇黎世機場起飛，往南飛越阿爾卑斯山，前往羅馬。","這是瑞士最大的國際機場，位在蘇黎世市中心以北約 13 公里。"],"en":["Taking off from Zurich, heading south over the Alps to Rome.","Switzerland's largest international airport, it lies about 13 km north of central Zurich."]},{"t0":17.0,"dur":19.85,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":36.85,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右下方是托迪山，海拔 3,613 公尺，格拉魯斯阿爾卑斯最高峰。","它位在格勞賓登州與格拉魯斯州交界，1824 年首次登頂。"],"en":["Below on the right: the Tödi, 3,613 m, the highest of the Glarus Alps.","On the border of the cantons of Grisons and Glarus, it was first climbed in 1824."],"poi":"todi"},{"t0":49.85,"dur":21.52,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":71.38,"dur":19.5,"zh":["右側是科莫湖，義大利第三大湖。","湖深超過 400 公尺，是歐洲最深的湖泊之一。","古冰河把它切出三條分支，形成 Y 字形。"],"en":["On the right: Lake Como, the third-largest lake in Italy.","More than 400 m deep, it is one of the deepest lakes in Europe.","An ancient glacier carved its three branches into a Y."],"poi":"como"},{"t0":90.88,"dur":30.73,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":121.61,"dur":13.0,"zh":["飛越波河，義大利最長的河，全長 652 公里。","它沿北緯 45 度往東，在威尼斯附近注入亞得里亞海。"],"en":["Crossing the Po, the longest river in Italy at 652 km.","It runs east along the 45th parallel to a delta on the Adriatic near Venice."],"poi":"po"},{"t0":134.61,"dur":41.84,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":176.45,"dur":6.5,"zh":["左側是佛羅倫斯，歷史中心 1982 年列入世界遺產。"],"en":["On the left: Florence, its historic centre a World Heritage Site since 1982."],"poi":"florence"},{"t0":182.95,"dur":12.61,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":195.56,"dur":13.0,"zh":["下方是西恩納，歷史中心 1995 年列入世界遺產。","源自中世紀的賽馬節，就在城中的田野廣場舉行。"],"en":["Below: Siena, its historic centre a World Heritage Site since 1995.","Its horse race of mediaeval origin, the Palio, is run in the Piazza del Campo."],"poi":"siena"},{"t0":208.56,"dur":21.58,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":230.14,"dur":19.5,"zh":["左側是博爾塞納湖，歐洲最大的火山湖。","岩漿庫掏空後地面塌陷，形成了這座湖。","湖南邊的兩座小島，來自水下的火山噴發。"],"en":["On the left: Lake Bolsena, the largest volcanic lake in Europe.","It formed where the ground collapsed over an emptied magma chamber.","Its two islands, in the south, rose from underwater eruptions."],"poi":"bolsena"},{"t0":249.64,"dur":27.86,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":277.5,"dur":13.0,"zh":["降落羅馬菲烏米奇諾機場，正式名稱是李奧納多·達文西機場。","這是義大利最繁忙的機場，1961 年正式啟用。"],"en":["Landing at Rome Fiumicino, officially Leonardo da Vinci Airport.","The busiest airport in Italy, it officially opened in 1961."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"起飛：蘇黎世機場","en":"Takeoff: Zurich Airport"},{"t":42.7,"tt":667,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 7 公里：托迪山","en":"Tödi, 7 km right","k":"todi"},{"t":65.64,"tt":1051,"kind":"toc","zh":"爬升至巡航高度 35,000 呎","en":"Top of climb, 35,000 ft"},{"t":80.15,"tt":1176,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 22 公里：科莫湖","en":"Lake Como, 22 km right","k":"como"},{"t":127.46,"tt":1854,"kind":"poi","zh":"正下方：波河","en":"Po (below)","k":"po"},{"t":175.21,"tt":2659,"kind":"tod","zh":"開始下降","en":"Top of descent"},{"t":179.37,"tt":2691,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 16 公里：佛羅倫斯","en":"Florence, 16 km left","k":"florence"},{"t":201.41,"tt":2949,"kind":"poi","zh":"正下方：西恩納","en":"Siena (below)","k":"siena"},{"t":238.92,"tt":3563,"kind":"poi","zh":"左側 13 公里：博爾塞納湖","en":"Lake Bolsena, 13 km left","k":"bolsena"},{"t":300.0,"tt":4500,"kind":"arr","zh":"降落：羅馬菲烏米奇諾機場","en":"Landing: Rome Fiumicino Airport"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：航路取兩機場間的大圓航線，高度、速度與時間依一般客機爬升下降推算，並非實際航班紀錄；大部分雲層已移除。","en":"Simulation: a great-circle path between the airports, with height, speed and times estimated from typical airliner climbs and descents. Not a real flight record; most clouds are removed."},"geo_src":"great circle between the airports","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Zurich Airport","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/articles/Zurich_Airport"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Tödi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%C3%B6di"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Lake Como","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Como"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Po (river)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Po_(river)"},{"title":"UNESCO World Heritage Centre: World Heritage List (Italy)","url":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/search=italy&order=year"},{"title":"Italia.it: Siena historic centre","url":"https://www.italia.it/en/tuscany/things-to-do/siena-historic-centre"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Lake Bolsena","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Bolsena"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Rome Fiumicino Airport","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/articles/Rome_Fiumicino_Airport"}]}